  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/Logos/logo-forge.png\" alt=\"Logo\">\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    |\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge（Forge版）</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">發布版本（Forge版）</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits-for-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge（Fabric版）</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits-for-fabric/files\" rel=\"nofollow\">發布版本（Fabric版）</a>\n    |\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\">\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/\" rel=\"nofollow\">原始碼</a> \n    |\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題回報</a>\n    |\n    <a href=\"https://github.com/ChiselsAndBits/Chisels-and-Bits/pulls\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull Requests</a> \n    |\n    <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> \n    |\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fpartner%252fchisels-and-bits-glv\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreeperHost</a> \n    |\n</div><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Patreon.png\" alt=\"Patreon\">\n  </a><div>\n  感謝您遊玩我們的模組！如果您想支持我們持續開發 Chisels and Bits 的努力，請考慮在 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/chisels_and_bits\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> 上贊助我們。\n</div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fpartner%252fchisels-and-bits-glv\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CreeperHost.png\" alt=\"CreeperHost\">\n  </a><div>\n  感謝 CreeperHost 慷慨的贊助，現在您向他們購買伺服器時可以獲得 25% 折扣。點擊上方圖片，或在結帳時使用 'chisels-and-bits' 作為折扣碼！\n</div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/ForForge.png\" alt=\"For Forge\"><div>\n  如果您想在 Fabric 上遊玩 Chisels &amp; Bits，則需要一個不同版本的模組。這是專為與 Fabric、其載入器和 API 相容而設計的版本。\n  此特定版本的模組可以在<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chisels-bits-for-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>找到。\n</div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Wiki.png\" alt=\"Wiki\">\n  </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwiki.chiselsandbits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">wiki</a><div>\n  我們所有的物品、方塊和系統都在那裡有詳細說明。\n</div><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Discord.png\" alt=\"Discord\">\n  </a><div>\n  如果您想加入伺服器，可以點擊上方圖片，或點擊<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.chisels-and-bits.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。\n</div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/Contents.png\" alt=\"模組內容\"><div>\n  <div>想要更平滑的階梯？放手去做吧。</div>\n  <div>想要更美觀的屋頂或柱子？現在一切皆有可能。</div>\n</div><div>\n  您可以透過混合搭配不同既有方塊的碎片，創造出全新的外觀和質感的方塊。\n</div><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CompatibilityVanilla.png\" alt=\"與原版相容\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ChiselsAndBits/Assets/main/CurseForge/Headers/CompatibilityMods.png\" alt=\"與模組相容\"><ul>\n  <li>\n    <code>chiselsandbits:chiselable/forced</code>\n    用於強制方塊可被雕刻（方便用於玻璃類方塊）\n  </li>\n  <li>\n    <code> chiselsandbits:chiselable/blocked</code>\n    用於阻止通常可雕刻的方塊被雕刻。\n  </li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
